Package: MITIGRE
Title: Modèle Intégré de Transfert Isotopique Global des Ressources en Eau
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Guillaume", "Cinkus", email = "guillaume.cinkus@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Vincent", "Marc", role = "aut"))
Description: Shiny application for modelling isotopic tracers (3H, 14C, 18O, 2H) with
    lumped parameter models (exponential, exponential-piston, partial exponential,
    dispersion and piston flow models, and mixtures), calibrated by Monte Carlo, with a
    forward (convolution) and a backward (TracerLPM, Jurgens et al. 2012) engine.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    bslib,
    ggplot2,
    parallel,
    shiny,
    stats,
    utils
